WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.440
<i>I don't know...</i>

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.400
<i>I don't know!</i>

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:11.150
<i>It's not just that your wish doesn't come true when you lose three times;</i>

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.160
<i>your wish is reversed.</i>

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Hitoe's wish was to make friends.</i>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<i>And when you reverse her wish...</i>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.540
<i>She loses... her friends?</i>

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>That's not all.</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.710
<i>She will never make friends again.</i>

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.840
<i>And now, with her third loss,</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.700
<i>the battle for her wish has ended.</i>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.760
<i>The words written here...
Hitoe told me that she can't see them.</i>

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.410
<b>Sharing all the fun and happy words with everyone...
<i>The words written here...
Hitoe told me that she can't see them.</i></b>

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:43.020
<i>She also said she doesn't know you girls.</i>

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:48.310
<i>All the memories she made during
her time as a Selector have disappeared.</i>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.530
<i>I...</i>

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.900
<i>I just don't know what to do anymore!</i>

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.710
<i>I don't know, but...</i>

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:11.340
Hello, Kurebayashi— Oh, Ruuko-san?

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:14.090
I heard you were sick. Are you better now?

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.390
U-Uhm, is Yuzuki...?

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:19.050
<i>She hasn't come home yet.</i>

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.350
<i>Hello? Did something happen?</i>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.600
N-Nothing! Sorry to bother you!

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.230
Ruuko-san—

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.420
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:58.930
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:03.740
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:07.690
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:08.940
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:16.990
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:20.240
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:25.330
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:30.630
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:36.380
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.470
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:46.810
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:53.020
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:57.780
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.450
One, two.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.580
One, two!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.580
<i>No more battles.</i>

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:14.540
<i>I need to stop them.</i>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.760
Any here?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.130
No. I don't sense anything.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.730
Yuzuki-chan?

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.190
I haven't seen her yet today.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:38.610
Is something wrong?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:38.990
No—

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.700
I summon Amber! Amber, Attack!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:44.910
If only I had a Guard card...

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.120
What's the matter?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.020
Ruu?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.770
Ruu's not happy.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.650
Sad?

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.280
No...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.610
Then let's battle!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.620
A battle will make Ruu happy again!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.540
<i>Making me grovel before you... You were </i>enjoying<i> this!</i>

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.710
No! I...

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.880
Ruu?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.460
I need to stop them.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:53.810
I can't go through there...

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.870
By the way, I can't get in touch with Akira at all.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.200
Akira?

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.390
Do you need her or something?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:19.630
Well, she took some outfits home with her...

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.380
Come on now, how could you let that happen?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:26.840
I'm sorry. I did ask her to return them, but...

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.050
Man...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.600
<i>They can't get in touch with Akira-san?</i>

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.810
What are you doing here?

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.850
U-Uhm...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.940
Are you here for a shoot? What magazine is it for?

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.980
Magazine?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.020
Well, I...

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.260
Oh, excuse me.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:47.360
She's my guest.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:51.490
Oh, so she's your friend, Iona-san? Sorry 'bout that, then!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.450
<i>Iona-san?</i>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.340
U-Um...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.770
I knew you wanted to do it too.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.020
You were feeling the <i>urge</i>, weren't you?

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.400
N-No! I just wanted to see Akira-san and talk with—

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.440
Oh. What do you want from Akira?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.650
Well...

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.570
She's not here anymore.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.200
Or rather, she'll probably
never come back again.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:31.990
Huh?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:36.040
She lost a battle against us.
And she lost to you too, right?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:42.590
You came here to see if the girl you beat is well?

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.300
How sweet of you.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.550
But perhaps this is just a victory parade for you?

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.720
That's not it!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:54.720
Akira lost to another Selector besides us before...

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.730
Wait... That means...

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.940
You and Iona put on the finishing touches.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.610
She lost thrice already. Game over for her.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.610
No...

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.070
Then... Akira-san is...

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.030
I don't know.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.830
She might be off crying for her mommy somewhere.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.160
Just like your friend.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.450
My friend?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.210
Hitoe-chan. Isn't she your friend?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.500
Hitoe? What did you do to Hitoe?

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:28.090
Hitoe... we beat her, too.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.480
A... battle?

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:47.070
I'm sorry, but Hitoe... well,
her wish has already come true.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.320
So she doesn't need
to battle anymo—

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:53.450
I'm so happy that your wish already came true before you lost three times.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.830
I'm <i>so</i> happy...

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:05.840
This girl, too, has a very earnest wish she wants to see fulfilled. So... how about it?

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.860
That's right... I already have
Ruuko and Yuzuki as friends.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:13.510
So even if I lose...

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.800
Hitoe...

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.850
All right. Let's battle.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:26.230
She didn't know what it meant to lose three times.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:27.690
It can't be...

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.150
You knew that Hitoe already had two losses?

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.070
You knew, and yet...

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.240
That's terrible! Why did you—?!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.240
Are you finally in the mood?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.370
You just <i>can't</i> forgive us for what we did, right?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.480
You <i>want</i> to battle, don't you?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.630
Battle!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.590
Even if I... battled you...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.840
Hitoe will never again...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.390
Wish.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.850
A wish... did you find one?

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.060
A wish...

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.650
You found one.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:07.940
I don't have any wishes.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:09.820
A lie.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:17.780
You were the one who told me that battling as a Selector without having a wish is blasphemy!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.830
But I'm glad I don't have any wishes...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.120
I can always quit battling—

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.290
No! Don't quit battling!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.670
Tama wants to battle together with Ruu!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.460
Battle more!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:33.490
I'm sorry, Tama... But I already...

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:38.220
Wanting friends and wanting to be together with someone you love...

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.930
Those kinds of wishes are worthless.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.060
They're not worthless!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.230
Your wish is different from the others.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.370
I told you, I don't have any wishes!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.770
But you do. We know you do.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.990
You <i>don't</i> know! Why? Why are you saying this?

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:01.490
My wish... is the same as yours.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.910
It was the first time I felt like that.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.840
I didn't have a bad life.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.050
It wasn't especially good either.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.970
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:22.810
All I did every day was live.
I didn't ever question that.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:25.450
I assumed that was all there was to it. But then...

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.310
I felt it.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.020
I understood it.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.900
I savored it.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.880
That feeling...

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:39.570
It was the first time I ever really felt <i>alive</i>.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.530
I felt my life and my soul.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:48.160
Battle is my blood, my flesh, my bones.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.540
No...

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.210
It's my very being.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:11:00.180
But... if you lose three times, you'll have to suffer...

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:03.180
And if you win, someone else will suffer instead.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.510
That's...

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.470
It can't be helped.
That's what these battles are about.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:11.460
That's what we are about. Me...

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:12.940
and you.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.570
Is she wrong?

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.690
I...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.570
You felt it, too.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:23.530
Once you feel that excitement, there's no way you can quit.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.540
Try as you might, you can't keep the urge down...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.370
You want it... You want to <i>do</i> it, right?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.750
I want to do it with you.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.170
How about you, Ruuko?

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.390
I want to do it.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.260
Ruuko!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.890
I want to battle, too...

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.440
I want to do it... I really want to do it...

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:54.790
But...!

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.190
Open.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.980
What's the matter?

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:19.050
You said you wanted to battle.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.300
I-I did say that, but...
this isn't what I meant!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.430
Then what <i>did</i> you mean?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.720
Just let go and have some fun.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.940
Let's get started, then.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.420
Battle!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.480
Hey, Ruu!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:24.360
Oh, my. Hitoe-chan was a lot more fun to play with, you know?

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.780
Get Bible

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.080
<i>A spell searching for low-level cards?</i>

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.380
<i>Why would she use that now?</i>

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.800
<i>This is strange... something isn't right...</i>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.300
<i>Why is she only using low-level attacks?</i>

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.850
Tama, Grow!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.360
Ruu! Battle! Do it seriously!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.290
Very good, Iona.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:19.960
You used a search spell to look through your deck and find out what was used in your Life Cloth.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.880
If Ruuko attacks now...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.260
Tama doesn't attack! Turn End!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.470
Oh? Well then...

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.680
<i>Next is...</i>

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.060
Spell. Blessed Reminiscence!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.350
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.600
Here it comes!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.980
Arts! Anti Spell!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:39.390
Anti Spell

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.410
Very good, Tama-chan!

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.340
Say, don't you want to keep battling?

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.680
I want more!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.010
For eternity?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.850
"Eternity"? What is "eternity"? I don't know!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.230
It means "forever."

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.540
Forever! I want it!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.150
Forever! I want to battle for eternity!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.490
Eternity!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.680
Yuzuki.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.620
Over there. She's a Selector.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.520
<i>She's...</i>

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.030
Where's Iona?

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.740
She's been in the dressing room.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.530
Isn't it about time you bring her here?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.910
Ah, yes! I'm sorry!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.920
<i>Yes, she is the one...</i>

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.170
Iona-chan!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.130
Huh?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.140
<i>I've found it...</i>

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.890
<i>finally.</i>

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.600
Tama! Wish Crisis!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.000
<i>I've found it!</i>

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.130
Iona-chan?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.740
The shoot is about to start.
Can you please stand by?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.100
Yes. I'll be there right away.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.270
That was incredible.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.310
Don't you think so, too?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.940
Well... I...

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:33.990
Want to battle again!

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.280
Tama likes battling Iona and Ulith!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.990
Forever battling! Forever battling for eternity! I love eternity!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.830
For eternity! For eternity!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.880
I've found it.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.270
We won.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:11.570
I wonder how many losses she has now...

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.600
It's okay.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.960
You can stay at home, Grandma.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.380
But...

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:36.170
The café Ruuko went to with her friend's mom is the one down the street, right?

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:36.880
Yes.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:41.390
She said that Ruuko got up and ran out in the middle of their conversation.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.180
Man, what's come over her?

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:47.310
Grandma, you stay put. I'll go look for her.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.280
<i>What just happened?</i>

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.240
<i>I...</i>

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:04.060
<i>I forgot about Hitoe, Yuzuki, and Akira-san...</i>

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:05.850
<i>I forgot about them all.</i>

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.600
<i>That was incredible.</i>

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.370
<i>Don't you think so, too?</i>

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.840
I'm scared... I'm scared!

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.220
What's happening to me?

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.010
Just how far am I going to go?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.550
Ruu?

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.430
Tama.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:29.600
I'm sorry, Tama. I can't battle anymore after all...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.650
Ruuko.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.070
Yuzuki!

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.020
U-Um...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:13.060
Hey, Yuzuki? You know, I—

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.190
So, did you do it?

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.610
Did you... battle?

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.990
So you did.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.860
I did it, too. And I won.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.620
<b>I wanna wanna
see you!
Bring Ruu-Ruu
along too!</b>

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.470
Akira told us to go to her.
<b>I wanna wanna
see you!
Bring Ruu-Ruu
along too!</b>

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.540
Akira told us to go to her.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.050
Akira-san?

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.930
Hanayo-san, do you sense anything?

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.520
No. Nothing.

